OL,3,CIran says Strait of Hormuz will not
OL,4,Copen until US 'corrects its behaviour'
OL,6,FIran has said the Strait of Hormuz
OL,7,Fwill not open until the United States
OL,8,F"corrects its behaviour," issuing new
OL,9,Fdemands that could shake up talks on a
OL,10,Fdeal to manage the vital shipping
OL,11,Froute.
OL,13,FThe ultimatum was made by the Supreme
OL,14,FNational Security Council, a politburo-
OL,15,Flike body which is chaired by the
OL,16,Fpresident and is tasked with forming
OL,17,Fand debating national security and
OL,18,Fmilitary policy.
OL,26,@pD@AOU
