CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786315684
OL,3,CIran says Strait of Hormuz will not
OL,4,Copen until US 'corrects its behaviour'
OL,6,FIn a statement shared by Iran's state
OL,7,Fbroadcaster, the council's secretary,
OL,8,FMohammad Bagher Zolghadr, said the
OL,9,FUnited States must never threaten Iran
OL,10,Fagain and must permanently end the war
OL,11,Fwith the Islamic Republic and allies
OL,12,Fin the region.
OL,14,FThe US must lift the naval blockade of
OL,15,FIranian ports and withdraw its
OL,16,Fmilitary from the area, demanded
OL,17,FZolghadr, who is also a commander in
OL,18,Fthe Revolutionary Guard.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786315684
OL,3,CIran says Strait of Hormuz will not
OL,4,Copen until US 'corrects its behaviour'
OL,6,FIt also must "completely compensate"
OL,7,FIran for war damage, lift sanctions
OL,8,Fand "unconditionally" release frozen
OL,9,Fassets, he added.
OL,11,FThere was no immediate comment from
OL,12,Fthe US, which says it wants an
OL,13,Facceptable deal first on the Strait of
OL,14,FHormuz before ending its blockade of
OL,15,FIranian ports.
OL,17,FAccording to the interim deal signed
OL,18,Fin June, a schedule to end sanctions
OL,19,Fand plan on compensation would be part
OL,20,Fof the final deal, and negotiations
OL,21,Fwould address frozen assets.
OL,26,@nD@NOUnD@dO]pD@EOUpD@UO]
