OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786315684
OL,3,CIran says Strait of Hormuz will not
OL,4,Copen until US 'corrects its behaviour'
OL,6,FThe end of a 60-day period to
OL,7,Fnegotiate a final deal will end in
OL,8,Fjust over a week but could be extended.
OL,10,FIran has said it was close to reaching
OL,11,Fa separate deal with Oman to manage
OL,12,Fthe strait, which runs between the two
OL,13,Fcountries, denying that direct talks
OL,14,Fwere ongoing with the US,
OL,15,Fcontradictory to President Donald
OL,16,FTrump's claims.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
