OL,3,CIran says Strait of Hormuz will not
OL,4,Copen until US 'corrects its behaviour'
OL,6,FIranian Foreign Minister Abbas
OL,7,FAraghchi earlier on Saturday said they
OL,8,Fwere close to reaching an agreement
OL,9,Fwith Oman on navigation, "specifically
OL,10,Fthe determination of a transit route."
OL,12,FHowever, the waterway's reopening is
OL,13,Fcontingent on other conditions, he
OL,14,Fsaid in remarks shared on social
OL,15,Fmedia, and blamed the situation on
OL,16,Fwhat he called the US violation of the
OL,17,Finterim deal.
