OL,3,CIran says Strait of Hormuz will not
OL,4,Copen until US 'corrects its behaviour'
OL,6,FOman, a mediator Gulf Arab country
OL,7,Fwhich has said relatively little on
OL,8,Fthe talks, said in a statement on
OL,9,FSaturday that the discussions were
OL,10,Fongoing "in a positive and
OL,11,Fconstructive atmosphere," and
OL,12,Fcondemned attacks on ships on the
OL,13,Fstrait.
OL,15,FThe strait, crucial to global supplies
OL,16,Fof oil and natural gas, had been
OL,17,Fconsidered an international waterway
OL,18,Fbefore the war.
