OL,3,CIran says Strait of Hormuz will not
OL,4,Copen until US 'corrects its behaviour'
OL,6,FTransit through the passage remains
OL,7,Flow ever since Iran imposed a blockade
OL,8,Fin response to the US and Israel's
OL,9,Fattacks on February 28, 2026 ` a
OL,10,Fstrategy that has given Tehran
OL,11,Fleverage in this conflict.
OL,13,FEarlier on Sunday Emirati authorities
OL,14,Fsaid a vessel owned by Abu Dhabi's
OL,15,Fstate-owned ADNOC oil and gas company
OL,16,Fwas attacked while transiting the
OL,17,FStrait of Hormuz, Emirati.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
