OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FThe Foreign Ministry said Iran fired
OL,12,Fthe missile as part of attacks on
OL,13,Fcommercial shipping.
OL,15,FADNOC in a statement said there were
OL,16,Fno casualties following the attack.
OL,17,FThe company said over a dozen of its
OL,18,Fvessels have been attacked by missiles
OL,19,Fand drones while transiting the strait
OL,20,Fsince the war.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
