OL,3,CIran says Strait of Hormuz will not
OL,4,Copen until US 'corrects its behaviour'
OL,6,FOne crew member has been killed and 20
OL,7,Fothers wounded, it said. ADNOC didn't
OL,8,Felaborate on the attack's location or
OL,9,Fany damage.
OL,11,FLater, the United Kingdom Maritime
OL,12,FTrade Operations Centre said a vessel
OL,13,Feast of the town of Khasab, Oman, had
OL,14,Fbeen struck by a projectile that
OL,15,Fcaused a fire that was put out, with
OL,16,Fthe vessel and crew safe. It was not
OL,17,Fclear whether this was the ADNOC
OL,18,Fincident.
